    "Description": "Bosh menyu (Prefabs/GameMenu.zprefab namunasi): \"O'ynash\" yuklanish ekraniga, u esa 1-darajaga olib boradi; \"Sozlamalar\" - ekran o'lchami, to'liq ekran, VSync, grafika sifati, gamma, ovoz va til; \"Chiqish\". GameSession shu yerda yaratiladi va butun o'yin davomida yashaydi (DontDestroyOnLoad).",
